:: Gwylan Pose Hold
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.poseHold to true>>
<<set $gwylan.pose to { pose: "", round: 0, holds: 0, eased: 0, stopped: false }>>
Gwylan touches your collar, and a loose thread of green light hangs down from it.
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>You touch the light thread at your collar before looking back at Gwylan. "Could you see how long I can stay still? I don't mind trying, if you don't make me hold it for too long."
	<<case "polite">>"Would you mind helping me test something?" you ask. "I want to see how long I can hold a pose without moving."
	<<case "flamboyant">>You straighten up and present the light thread at your collar with one hand. "You have that notebook out often enough. You may as well give me something worth drawing."
	<<case "docile">>You take hold of the loose end of the thread and offer it to Gwylan. "You can choose the pose. I want to see whether I can stay where you put me."
	<<case "bratty" "cruel">>You hold the leash out towards <<him>>. "Bet you can't keep me in one place for five minutes. Try it."
	<<case "confident">>"Give me a pose and time me," you say. "I want to see how long I can keep it."
	<<default>>"Would you like to see how long I can hold a pose?" you ask, touching the light thread at your collar.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
Gwylan stops halfway through turning a page in the ledger. <<He>> looks from you to the thread,
then reaches under the counter for a small notebook and the short pencil <<he>> keeps with it.
<br><br>
"Ooh, I'd love to see that," <<he>> says, already opening to a clean page.
"But if it starts hurting more than you expected, you must tell me to stop. I mean it.
The thread comes off the moment you say so."
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
	<<He>> comes round the counter and walks once around you,
	paying more attention to your shoulders and feet than your clothes.
	"Choose the first one yourself, dear. I'd like to see which pose you pick before I start fussing with you."
<<else>>
	<<He>> steps back far enough to look at you from head to toe, pencil resting against the notebook.
	"Pick something you can actually hold. Once you're in position, I'll adjust the thread,
	so you don't have to keep fixing your position."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Kneel on the floorboards|Gwylan Pose Hold Round]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.pose to "kneel">><<set $gwylan.pose.round to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stand, hands behind your back|Gwylan Pose Hold Round]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.pose to "stand">><<set $gwylan.pose.round to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
	<<link [[Sit up on your heels, hands curled like paws|Gwylan Pose Hold Round]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.pose to "beg">><<set $gwylan.pose.round to 1>><<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("petplay")>><<pass 5>><</link>><<deviant2>>
<<else>>
	<<insufficientStat "deviancy" "to sit up like a pet">>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Change your mind|Gwylan Pose Hold Stop]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Round
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _p to $gwylan.pose.pose>>
<<set _dom to (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
<<set _lust to _gs.includes("lust")>>
<<switch _p>>
	<<case "kneel">>
		You lower yourself onto the floorboards and rest your weight on your knees.
		<br><br>
		The wood is colder than you expected. Gwylan touches two fingers to the glowing thread at your collar,
		drawing it upwards until it passes over the beam above you.
		<br><br>
		When <<he>> lets go, there is enough slack for you to turn your head,
		but if your chin starts to drop the thread gently pulls it back up.
	<<case "stand">>
		You put your hands behind your back and clasp them together.
		<br><br>
		Gwylan raises the thread a little at a time, waiting for you to follow it rather than pulling you into place.
		Your shoulders roll back as your chin lifts.
		<br><br>
		Once <<he>> stops, you find yourself looking towards a wooden beam above you,
		where a small spider is making its way along the edge.
	<<default>>
		You sit up on your heels and curl your hands loosely in front of your chest.
		<br><br>
		Gwylan's eyebrows rise before <<he>> can hide the reaction.
		<br><br>
		"You picked that one yourself," <<he>> says, sounding far too interested,
		then lifts the thread until your chin is held a little higher and your back straightens with it.
<</switch>>
<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "bird", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
	<br><br>
	Your tail twitches behind you. You try to keep it still, so the rest of your body does not move too.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _dom>>
	Gwylan moves behind you, close enough to adjust one shoulder with <<his>> fingertips before stepping away again.
	"Keep that pose. Let's see whether you can keep it once your shoulders and legs start to ache."
	<br><br>
	The pencil begins scratching across the page somewhere outside your view.
<<else>>
	Gwylan opens the notebook and starts drawing. "Keep looking where you are.
	I'm doing the line of your neck and shoulders first, so you'll know exactly which bit you ruined if you move."
	<br><br>
	<<His>> tone is light, but <<he>> watches closely whenever you move.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Hold still|Gwylan Pose Hold Round Two]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.holds to $gwylan.pose.holds + 1>><<set $gwylan.pose.round to 2>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Shift your weight a little|Gwylan Pose Hold Round Two]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.eased to $gwylan.pose.eased + 1>><<set $gwylan.pose.round to 2>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say "stop"|Gwylan Pose Hold Stop]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.stopped to true>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Round Two
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _p to $gwylan.pose.pose>>
<<if _p is "kneel">>
	The pressure beneath your knees has changed from uncomfortable to a steady ache.
	You shift your toes against the boards, careful not to move the rest of your legs.
<<elseif _p is "stand">>
	Keeping your shoulders back is becoming harder.
	The thread still catches your chin whenever your head starts to lower,
	so the ache moves to the back of your neck instead.
<<else>>
	Your hands have been curled in the same position long enough that your fingers begin to tremble.
	You loosen them as much as the pose allows, then try to make them still again.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $gwylan.pose.eased gt 0>>
	Gwylan notices the small adjustment immediately.
	<br><br>
	"Ah, there. That's the bit your body wanted to change,"
	<<he>> says, marking something in the notebook before <<he>> continues drawing.
	"Leave it that way if it hurts less. I wanted a drawing, not an injury."
<<else>>
	Gwylan lowers the pencil for a moment and studies you without speaking.
	<br><br>
	"Not even a wiggle?" <<he>> says at last, sounding more surprised than impressed. <<He>> looks back to the page.
	"Stubborn. All right, I need another few minutes."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pose Hold Round Check]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Round Check
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _dom to (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
<<set _lust to _gs.includes("lust")>>
<<if $gwylan.poseGentle>>
	<<He>> comes closer<<if $gwylan.pose.pose isnot "stand">> and crouches beside you<</if>>, checking the angle of the thread before <<he>> checks your face.
	<br><br>
	"We're halfway. If you want out, say so, now or later. Either is perfectly fine, dear."
	<<He>> waits long enough for you to answer with a nod or a shake of your head before returning to the notebook.
<<elseif _dom>>
	<<He>> steps into your view<<if $gwylan.pose.pose isnot "stand">> and crouches<</if>> so you can see <<him>> without moving your head.
	<br><br>
	"You know how to stop this," <<he>> says, tapping the thread where it meets your collar.
	"If the ache gets worse, you may choose again. Though I do like the view."
<<elseif _lust>>
	Gwylan comes close and watches the thread move with each breath you take.
	<<His>> fingertips caress the side of your jaw and stop beside the collar.
	<br><br>
	"You can hold a pose better than I expected," <<he>> says.
	<<His>> hand lingers near your collar for a moment before <<he>> pulls it away and returns to the notebook.
<<else>>
	<<He>> sits cross-legged on the floor where you can see <<him>>,
	resting the notebook on one knee. After another look at you, <<he>> begins reading <<his>> notes aloud.
	<br><br>
	"Subject keeps looking at the ginger tin. Subject is pretending this has nothing to do with wanting a biscuit later."
	<<He>> glances towards the tin, then back at you. "I haven't decided whether that counts as movement."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Hold still|Gwylan Pose Hold End]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.holds to $gwylan.pose.holds + 1>><<pass 5>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Hold through it, whatever it costs|Gwylan Pose Hold End]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.holds to $gwylan.pose.holds + 1>><<set $gwylan.pose.hard to true>><<pass 5>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[Ease out of the pose|Gwylan Pose Hold End]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.eased to $gwylan.pose.eased + 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask to stop|Gwylan Pose Hold Stop]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.stopped to true>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Stop
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<if $gwylan.pose and $gwylan.pose.round gt 0>>
	"Stop this," you say.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan moves instantly. <<He>> touches the thread and loosens it first,
	taking the pull away from your collar before the light fades completely.
	The notebook closes under <<his>> other arm as <<he>> comes beside you.
	<br><br>
	"Stay there for a second and move slowly when you're ready," <<he>> says,
	keeping one hand near your shoulder while you recover.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
		<<He>> keeps one hand near your shoulder while you ease yourself out of the pose.
		<br><br>
		"Mnn. You stopped when you needed to, which is exactly what I asked for."
		<<He>> watches until you are steady again before stepping back.
	<<else>>
		"Thank you for telling me," <<he>> says, looking from you to the abandoned page in the notebook.
		"Now I know where it becomes too much. We can make it shorter next time, or pick something else entirely."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $gwylan.poseGentle to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Gwylan looks at the empty page, then back at you.
	<br><br>
	"Changed your mind?" <<He>> closes the notebook without complaint and slips the pencil behind one ear.
	"All right. I can think of several things that involve much less standing still."
	<br><br>
	<<unset $gwylan.pose>><<unset $daily.gwylan.poseHold>>
	<<gwylanOptions>>
<</if>>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold End
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _p to $gwylan.pose.pose>>
<<set _dom to (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
<<set _comp to ($hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1 and $gwylan.pose.hard and !$willpowerSuccess)>>
<<if $gwylan.pose.hard>>
	<<if _comp>>
		<<hypnosisText "Your body stays in the pose, and you could not have left it if you tried.">>
		You try to relax your muscles, expecting your shoulders to lower, but they stay in position.
		<br><br>
		Your arms and legs remain exactly where Gwylan placed them, even after you stop trying to hold them there.
		You can't tell whether you are still obeying <<him>> on instinct, or whether something else is keeping you in place.
	<<else>>
		The longer you hold the pose, the more uncomfortable it gets. Your arms start to feel stiff but you keep yourself still.
		<br><br>
		Every so often, you almost let your chin drop without thinking, but lift it before you change the pose.
		You stay still until Gwylan finally lowers the pencil.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $gwylan.pose.holds gte 2>>
	Gwylan waits until the last few seconds have passed before touching the thread. It loosens gradually,
	giving you time to lower your chin and move your shoulders before the light disappears.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> stays close while you <<if _p is "stand">>lower your arms and relax your shoulders<<else>>get to your feet<</if>>, watching your legs in case they give way.
<<elseif $gwylan.pose.holds is 1>>
	By the end of the session, you are finding it harder to concentrate on the pose.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan touches the thread until it loosens and fades. When <<he>> tells you that you can move,
	you <<if _p is "stand">>lower your arms and relax your shoulders<<else>>slowly get to your feet<</if>>, leaning against <<him>> for support.
	<<He>> keeps a hand on your back until you are steady on your feet again.
<<else>>
	You start moving out of the pose before the time is up. Gwylan comes over and touches the thread until it fades,
	then holds out a hand to help you <<if _p is "stand">>steady yourself<<else>>get to your feet<</if>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears")) and $gwylan.pose.holds gte 1>>
	Your ears twitch as you relax, and you notice how tense you have been holding them.
	Gwylan notices you twitch them and reaches up to gently massage around the base of each ear.
	<br><br>
	When <<he>> finds a tender spot and one of your ears jerks away, <<he>> eases the pressure before continuing.
	The soreness begins to fade.<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pose Hold End Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold End Result
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _dom to (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
<<if $gwylan.pose.holds gte 2>>
	Before saying anything, Gwylan looks between you and the sketch, adding one last mark to the page.
	"You stayed still longer than I thought you would."
	<br><br>
	<<if _dom>>
		<<His>> eyes move down your body, lingering on your legs as you stretch them.
		<br><br>
		"I kept waiting for your knees to start shaking badly enough to make you move."
		A grin spreads across <<his>> face. "But you really did stay there."
		<br><br>
		When you put your weight back on both feet, your legs feel stiff from holding the same position for so long.
		Gwylan notices you shifting and holds your arm before you can stumble. "I want to try a harder one next time..."
		<<npcincr Gwylan dom 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> turns the notebook towards you and points at the sketch.
		<br><br>
		"Look over here." <<His>> finger moves along the line of your jaw in the drawing.
		"I had to change this part every time you started breathing differently."
		<br><br>
		You look over the drawing while <<he>> compares it with your face again, tilting <<his>> head slightly.
		"I like this one. You stayed still long enough for me to finish it."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> keeps the notebook where you can see it, clearly waiting to see what you think.
	<</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<elseif $gwylan.pose.holds is 1>>
	Gwylan looks over the sketch, then back at you. <<He>> taps one of the marks near the side of the page.
	"You were fine at first, then your legs started shaking."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> crouches for a moment to look at your legs before standing again.
	<<if $gwylan.pose.pose is "stand">>
		"I want to try that pose again sometime, but for less time. Then I'll know how long you can stand comfortably."
	<<else>>
		"I want to try that pose again sometime, but with something under your knees.
		Then I'll know whether it was the pose or the floor."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> writes something beside the sketch, apparently pleased to have found something else to test.
<<else>>
	"Your legs?" Gwylan asks almost immediately.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> crouches beside you and looks them over while you stretch your legs.
	"Ah, yes, they started shaking before you moved."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> glances back at the unfinished sketch, then at you.
	"Next time <<if $gwylan.pose.pose is "stand">>we'll stop sooner<<else>>I'll put something softer under your knees<</if>>. I still want that drawing."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> closes the notebook and moves back, giving you room to stretch.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _dom to (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
<<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("pose_hold")>>
Gwylan folds a blanket around your shoulders and guides you to the window seat before disappearing behind the counter.
<br><br>
<<He>> returns with a warm mug and a tin of ginger biscuits, then sits beside you and puts the open tin within reach.
You can still feel where the leash had pulled against your collar. You rub your neck once,
then take the mug in both hands.
<br><br>
<<if _dom and !$gwylan.pose.stopped>>
	Gwylan waits until you have the drink before speaking. "How was it?
	Was anything uncomfortable? Anything you want me to do differently next time?"
	<br><br>
	<<He>> keeps the notebook closed on <<his>> lap and waits for your answer.
<<else>>
	Gwylan nudges the biscuit tin towards you.
	<br><br>
	"Was that fun, or did I go too far?" <<He>> watches your face rather than reaching for the notebook.
	"I want to know before I decide what I'd change next time."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> you liked it|Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare Done]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.answer to "liked">><<stress -3>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 2>><</link>><<lstress>><<gglust>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> it was too much|Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare Done]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.answer to "much">><<stress -4>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<link [[Lean against <<him>> and say nothing|Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare Done]]>><<set $gwylan.pose.answer to "quiet">><<stress -4>><<trauma -1>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare Done
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch $gwylan.pose.answer>>
	<<case "liked">>
		<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek" "shy">>You turn the mug between your hands before admitting, "I liked it. More than I thought I would."
			<<case "polite">>"I liked it," you tell <<him>>. "Thank you for checking on me while we were doing it."
			<<case "flamboyant">>You sink back into the blanket. "You may keep that page in your notebook. I rather liked being the subject."
			<<case "docile">>You lean a little closer to <<him>>. "I liked staying where you put me. I'd let you do it again."
			<<case "bratty" "cruel">>You catch <<him>> watching for your answer. "You can stop looking worried. I liked it, and I'd have told you if I didn't."
			<<case "confident">>"I liked it," you say. "I'd do it again, even the longer version."
			<<default>>"I liked it," you say, rubbing the place where the thread had rested against your collar. "I'd try it again."
		<</switch>>
	<<case "much">>
		<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek" "shy">>You look down into the mug. "It was a bit too much. I thought I could hold it longer than I could."
			<<case "polite">>"I think that was too much for me," you say. "I'd rather make the next one shorter."
			<<case "flamboyant">>You shift the blanket higher around your shoulders and rub one knee. "You got your drawing. Next time, I want the shorter version."
			<<case "docile">>"I wanted to keep going because you asked me to," you admit. "But it was too much by the end."
			<<case "bratty" "cruel">>"You pushed that one too far," you tell <<him>>. "If we do it again, make it shorter."
			<<case "confident">>"Too much," you say. "I know where my limit is now. Next time we stop before that."
			<<default>>"It was too much," you say. "I don't want to hold it that long next time."
		<</switch>>
	<<default>>
		You move closer without answering until your shoulder rests against Gwylan's side, still wrapped in the blanket.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<switch $gwylan.pose.answer>>
	<<case "liked">>
		Gwylan's attention drops to the biscuit tin, and the tips of <<his>> ears turn red.
		<br><br>
		<<He>> takes out a biscuit and presses it into your hand. "Then I'll remember what worked."
		The notebook opens again, but <<he>> turns it away before writing a few quick lines.
		"You are not reading this over my shoulder."
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
			<br><br>
			Your tail keeps brushing the blanket beside you, making Gwylan glance down at it before
			<<he>> pretends to be very interested in <<his>> notes.
		<</if>>
	<<case "much">>
		Gwylan puts the notebook aside instead of writing.
		<br><br>
		"All right. Shorter next time, and I'll give you something softer to kneel on if we use the floor."
		<<He>> shifts closer so you do not have to reach far for the biscuits. <<set $gwylan.poseGentle to true>>
		<<if C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			<br><br>
			<<His>> hand caresses your hair. "If I'm to set the pace, I must listen when you tell me where it went wrong."
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<He>> glances at you once, then puts an arm around you without asking for anything else.
		<br><br>
		After a while <<he>> starts humming while you finish the drink.
		<<hypnosisText "With <<his>> arm around you, the ache bothers you less.">>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare Wrap]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pose Hold Aftercare Wrap
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
Gwylan stays beside you until the mug is empty and you start pushing the blanket away.
<br><br>
When you stand, your knees are stiff. <<He>> reaches for your elbow and keeps hold until you are steady again,
then lets you go without comment.
<br><br>
<<unset $gwylan.pose>>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Sunscreen
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.sunscreen to true>>
<<switch $gwylan.sun>>
	<<case "self">>
		You take the little tin and rub the salve over your face, neck, and forearms.
		A faint chamomile smell comes from the salve as you spread it over your skin,
		leaving the covered areas pleasantly cool.
		<br><br>
		Gwylan looks towards the sea while you work, giving you some privacy,
		though <<he>> checks once when you reach your ears to make sure you have not missed them.
		<br><br>
		When you hand the tin back, <<he>> looks over the places you covered and nods.
		"That should do it. Stay under the awning for a while before you head back into the sun,
		or you'll rub half of it off before it dries."
		<<set $player.skin.sunscreen.lastsUntil to $timeStamp + Skin.Sunscreen.duration>>
	<<case "face">>
		Gwylan pulls <<his>> chair closer and rests the open tin on one knee.
		<<He>> scoops up a little salve with two fingers and gestures for you to lift your face.
		"Chin up. Close your eyes, or you'll get this in them."
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			<<He>> puts one hand under your chin and tilts your face up while <<he>> rubs the salve over
			your forehead and cheeks with the other.
			<br><br>
			"Hold still," <<he>> says, rubbing some along your nose and jaw. "I'm almost done with your face."
		<<elseif _gs.includes("lust")>>
			Gwylan rubs the salve over your cheeks and jaw before moving down to your neck.
			<<He>> takes <<his>> time beneath your chin, carefully spreading it over the exposed skin.
			<br><br>
			When you glance at <<him>>, <<hes>> still looking at your neck.
			"You've caught the sun here, and I don't want it getting sore later."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan spreads the salve over your forehead and cheeks before moving along your nose.
			You wrinkle your nose when <<his>> fingers brush close to it.
			<br><br>
			"Stop doing that," <<he>> says with a small laugh. "You keep moving your face."
			<br><br>
			You relax again, and <<he>> finishes applying the salve.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Gwylan Sunscreen End]]>><</link>>
	<<case "trade">>
		When you offer to do <<his>> neck in return, Gwylan pauses with the tin in one hand.
		<br><br>
		"Oh! You want to do mine?" <<He>> glances towards the shaded part of the porch, then back at you.
		"I was planning to hide from the sun, but oh, all right."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> turns the chair around and lifts <<his>> hair away from <<his>> collar.
		"Not half the tin, mind. I don't need as much as you do."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Gwylan Sunscreen End]]>><</link>>
	<<default>>
		Gwylan closes the tin and slips it back into <<his>> apron pocket.
		<br><br>
		"All right. Keep to the shade when you can," <<he>> says, looking towards the bright patch beyond the awning.
		"If you change your mind tomorrow, I'll still have the tin."
<</switch>>
<<if ["face", "trade"].includes($gwylan.sun)>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<unset $gwylan.sun>>
	<br><br>
	<<gwylanOptions>>
<</if>>

:: Gwylan Sunscreen End
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<switch $gwylan.sun>>
	<<case "face">>
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>>
			<<His>> thumb reaches the base of one ear, making it twitch away from <<his>> hand.
			Gwylan immediately pulls back. "Sensitive?"
			<br><br>
			After the twitching stops, <<he>> tries the other side more gently,
			rubbing the salve over the exposed skin with a lighter touch.
			<<if Transformations.partActive("bunny", "ears")>>
				<<He>> supports each long ear with one hand while spreading the salve with the other.
			<<elseif Transformations.partActive("waterdragon", "ears")>>
				<<He>> follows the outer edges of each ear with a fingertip, easing the pressure whenever you twitch.
			<<else>>
				<<He>> parts the fur with <<his>> fingers so the salve reaches your skin.
			<</if>>
			Your ears still twitch when <<his>> fingers brush their bases, so <<he>> finishes with a few gentle strokes.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<set $player.skin.sunscreen.lastsUntil to $timeStamp + Skin.Sunscreen.duration>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<case "trade">>
		You rub the salve over the back of <<his>> neck, just above <<his>> collar.
		Gwylan stays still for you, but the tips of <<his>> ears slowly turn red as you continue.
		<br><br>
		You finish rubbing the last of it into <<his>> skin. Gwylan lets <<his>> hair fall back,
		then touches the back of <<his>> neck where the salve still feels cool.
		<br><br>
		"Thank you," <<he>> says. "Most people come here asking for my help. I'm not used to someone taking care of me."
		<<npcincr Gwylan lust 2>><<glust>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<He>> takes the tin from you and turns <<his>> chair back towards you.
		There is still some salve on <<his>> fingertips, so <<he>> rubs it gently over your nose and cheeks.
		"Now neither of us should get burned later."
		<<set $player.skin.sunscreen.lastsUntil to $timeStamp + Skin.Sunscreen.duration>>
<</switch>>
<<unset $gwylan.sun>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Forest Shop Dog Bed Wake Content
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<if $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "foot">>
	You stay at the foot of Gwylan's bed and pull your legs fully onto the mattress so
	your feet are no longer hanging over the edge. You draw the blanket closer and settle back down,
	unwilling to get up just yet.
<<else>>
	You pull the blanket closer and curl up in the pet bed again. It is still warm from the night,
	and you decide to stay there a little longer.
<</if>>
<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "bird", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
	Your tail shifts beneath the blanket before you settle down again.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !isGwylanAbsent()>>
	<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>
	<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
		Gwylan notices that you are still lying down and stops nearby.
		"You can stay there a little longer, dear. I have a few things to tidy up. There's no hurry."
	<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
		Gwylan stops beside the bed and looks down at you curled beneath the blanket. <<He>> checks the clock,
		then pulls the blanket back over your shoulder.
		"Five more minutes... After that, I'm getting to work, and I won't be quiet about it."
	<<else>>
		Gwylan notices you moving beneath the blanket and comes over. "Still want to sleep?
		I thought you'd get up once you woke." <<He>> smiles when you make no attempt to move. "Apparently not."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> fixes the blanket where it has slipped from your shoulder before returning to <<his>> work.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<sub 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get up|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><<if $gwylan.tuck>><<unset $gwylan.tuck.mode>><</if>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Shop Dog Bed Wake Embarrassed
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<if $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "foot">>
	You wake at the foot of Gwylan's bed. For a moment, you lie there without thinking about it.
	Then you remember that you were the one who asked to sleep there.
	<br><br>
	Embarrassed, you quickly pull the blanket over your face. The sudden movement makes it obvious that you are awake.
<<else>>
	You wake curled up in the pet bed and remember choosing to sleep there.
	Embarrassment quickly follows, and you pull the blanket over your face.
	<br><br>
	The rest of your body is still clearly visible in the bed,
	so hiding your face does little to hide what you are embarrassed about.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !isGwylanAbsent()>>
	<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>
	<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
		Gwylan notices you hiding under the blanket but does not try to pull it away.
		"All right, I'll turn around while you get up."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> faces the counter and leaves you alone to get out of bed.
	<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
		Gwylan watches you pull the blanket over your face and gives the covered top of your head a light pat.
		"You were the one who asked to sleep there. No use hiding from me now."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> leaves the blanket where it is and waits for you to come out on your own.
	<<else>>
		Gwylan laughs softly when you hide your face. "You weren't this shy about it last night!"
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get up|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><<if $gwylan.tuck>><<unset $gwylan.tuck.mode>><</if>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Shop Dog Bed Wake Defiant
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
You sit up and push the blanket off your legs.
<<if $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "foot">>
	"Don't expect me to sleep at the foot of your bed again."
<<elseif $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "stay">>
	"Don't expect me to let you sleep beside me again."
<<else>>
	"Don't expect me to sleep in this pet bed again."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !isGwylanAbsent()>>
	<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>
	<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
		Gwylan gives you room to get up and sigh. "Alright... You can sleep wherever you want next time."
	<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
		Gwylan smiles at your complaint.
		<<if $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "foot">>
			"You asked to sleep there, I didn't make you?"
		<<elseif $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "stay">>
			"You were happy enough to have me there last night..."
		<<else>>
			"You stayed there all night. Couldn't have been that bad..."
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		Gwylan starts putting the blanket back in place.
		<<if $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "foot">>
			"We'll see. You were the one who asked."
		<<elseif $gwylan.tuck and $gwylan.tuck.mode is "stay">>
			"All right, I'll remind you of that next time you ask me to stay."
		<<else>>
			"All right, I'll see if you still feel that way tonight."
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<def 1>><<npcincr Gwylan love -2>><<llove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get up|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><<if $gwylan.tuck>><<unset $gwylan.tuck.mode>><</if>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
